TowerGuide: Looks like some of the Hunter's staff have put up Job Requests! Perfect timing. Let's go over what they are and how they work.
TowerGuide: Job Requests come from the citizens of Starspire who need help with tasks inside the tower. Most requests revolve around hunting monsters and gathering their resources, things you're already familiar with! Complete them for hefty rewards that will help speed up your ascent!
TowerGuide: Job Requests are largely optional, so don't feel pressured to accept them. That said, the rewards they provide can be a great help on your journey up the tower.
TowerGuide: More Jobs will become available as you climb higher in the tower, so feel free to check back here from time to time for new requests!